          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP289 Vegreville

Deep wet grass was becoming the trend at the caps and caches today and we really should have dressed in more water repellent garb but alas, the goal of the cap was a higher priority than appropriate attire.  Besides, we could always dry out in the hotel in the evening.   Access from the north side was much better than attempting it from the highway and over the tracks.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
